#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-image.rst:5
msgid "Image"
msgstr "图像"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-image.rst:7
msgid ""
"This guide covers image generation through AIBrix's gateway. ``POST "
"/v1/images/generations`` is the endpoint AIBrix supports. vLLM-Omni "
"supports it, while SGLang-Omni does not support the image endpoints; see "
"the :ref:`supported endpoints <multimodal-supported-endpoints>`. ``POST "
"/v1/images/edits`` is not supported by the AIBrix gateway. Before you "
"start, finish the :ref:`prerequisites <omni-prerequisites>` and "
":ref:`gateway access <omni-access-gateway>` steps on the Multi-Modal "
"Serving page, and deploy your model the way the :ref:`video guide <omni-"
"video-deploy>` describes, swapping in an image model."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍通过 AIBrix 网关生成图像。AIBrix 支持 ``POST /v1/images/generations`` 端点。vLLM-"
"Omni 支持它，而 SGLang-Omni 不支持图像端点；参见 :ref:`支持的端点 <multimodal-supported-"
"endpoints>` 。AIBrix 网关不支持 ``POST /v1/images/edits`` 。开始之前，请先完成多模态服务页面上的 "
":ref:`前置条件 <omni-prerequisites>` 和 :ref:`访问网关 <omni-access-gateway>` "
"步骤，并按照 :ref:`视频指南 <omni-video-deploy>` 所述方式部署模型，换成图像模型。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-image.rst:12
msgid "Generate an Image"
msgstr "生成图像"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-image.rst:14
msgid ""
"``POST /v1/images/generations`` is a JSON request. Set ``model`` to the "
"name of your deployment, the value of its ``model.aibrix.ai/name`` label:"
msgstr ""
"``POST /v1/images/generations`` 是 JSON 请求。将 ``model`` 设置为你的部署名称，即其 "
"``model.aibrix.ai/name`` 标签的值："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-image.rst:29
msgid "What the gateway does with it:"
msgstr "网关如何处理它："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-image.rst:31
msgid ""
"It reads only ``model``, to select a pod, and forwards the body as sent. "
"``prompt``, ``size``, ``n`` and every other field are validated by the "
"engine."
msgstr ""
"网关只读取 ``model`` 来选择 Pod，并原样转发请求体。 ``prompt`` 、 ``size`` 、 ``n`` "
"及其他所有字段都由引擎校验。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-image.rst:32
msgid ""
"The response is forwarded without being parsed as a language response, so"
" no token usage is reported."
msgstr "响应不会作为语言类响应被解析，直接转发，因此不上报 token 用量。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-image.rst:33
msgid ""
"If the model's pods carry the ``model.aibrix.ai/engine: xdit`` label or "
"annotation, the gateway rewrites the path to xDiT's native ``/generate`` "
"endpoint."
msgstr ""
"如果模型的 Pod 带有 ``model.aibrix.ai/engine: xdit`` 标签或注解，网关会把路径改写为 xDiT 原生的 "
"``/generate`` 端点。"

